			"notes": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/frqnny/mostructures/compare/1.4.1+1.18.2...1.4.2+1.18.2\n\n## What's New\n\n- Removed the Volcanic Vent\n- Removed Savanna Villager Tower\n- Removed a certain Barnhouse (the structure is still there, only removed one bad variant)\n- Config v5 is here, and it allows the editing of specific structure's spacing, separation, as well as an on/off boolean like v3. The file should fully explain it.\n- Pirate Ship has no lights anymore so stuff spawns\n- The Castle In The Sky will no longer have OP spawners\n- Massive rebalancing. Structures might be a bit less rare. \n- As with above, we did rewrite the structure sets our structures aren't compatible with. To explain, Structure A and Structure B were incompatible with each other and if they were near, they would not generate- either of them. Now, say A is more important and should generate more often. Now, A does not check if B is nearby, but B does, and B will not generate. In this way, we prioritized certain structures to generate by avoiding checking for other structures, as those other structures are already checking for prioritized structures."
